{"id":"ba2a20cc422163c2b5a242534ba13b495ee4d0b2","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1250202","title":"部署在 cloudflare 上的 Pages 有 0 成本的方式让中国大陆用户访问吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"imherer","excerpt":"问与答 - @imherer - 有个小工具自己用，用到了 CF 的 pages 和 d1 ，主要是就是想利用 CF 的免费额度，但是部署后发现中国大陆不能访问","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>有个小工具自己用，用到了 CF 的 pages 和 d1 ，主要是就是想利用 CF 的免费额度，但是部署后发现中国大陆不能访问</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18199686\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/edb7/4af1/545105_normal.png?m=1787231152\" alt=\"MHPSY\" data-uid=\"545105\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MHPSY\">MHPSY</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-20 09:50:24 +08:00\">21h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没有特别好的办法 体验多少会有点问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18199819\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/75a9/7657/636986_normal.png?m=1789573151\" alt=\"C5H12O5\" data-uid=\"636986\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/C5H12O5\">C5H12O5</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-20 10:07:47 +08:00\">20h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>cf 的 pages 直连没问题的啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18199978\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3eda4ab2251053a7e9e217f3a790c446?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hunono\" data-uid=\"632255\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hunono\">hunono</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-20 10:27:15 +08:00\">20h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>将自己的域名 dns 放在 cf 上,然后将 pages 配置为自己的域名,就能访问了,广东不能访问可能是特殊地狱问题.<br>原理我初步观察是 pages 配置的默认域名没有 CDN,而自己的域名解析到 cf,再放在 pages 上就有 cdn.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18200212\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8e94764375431167a927580d4b075074?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"MagicalCarl\" data-uid=\"651270\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MagicalCarl\">MagicalCarl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-20 11:01:00 +08:00\">19h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>配个域名就能直连，就是慢一点，如果域名不是什么小众域名并且已经备案，还能直接在微信打开</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18200488\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b8ce/9f31/585950_normal.png?m=1745484378\" alt=\"jonty\" data-uid=\"585950\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jonty\">jonty</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-20 11:45:56 +08:00\">19h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不在乎体验的话，上 cdn 就行了吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18200672\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4b43/34f3/168471_normal.png?m=1741054480\" alt=\"Tokin\" data-uid=\"168471\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tokin\">Tokin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-20 12:43:19 +08:00\">18h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>弄个免费域名呗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18202851\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1d69/1982/292781_normal.png?m=1553547558\" alt=\"E1n\" data-uid=\"292781\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/E1n\">E1n</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-20 20:46:51 +08:00\">10h 12m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>字节火山新用户一元一年域名，今天买了个还可以</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"有个小工具自己用，用到了 CF 的 pages 和 d1 ，主要是就是想利用 CF 的免费额度，但是部署后发现中国大陆不能访问 1 MHPSY 21h 9m ago 没有特别好的办法 体验多少会有点问题 4 C5H12O5 PRO 20h 51m ago cf 的 pages 直连